        "raw": "<p>Nightmist does especially well if you have some good right off the bat heroes (I think of Wraith as one of those but YMMV) since it can seem like she&#39;s a slow starter. And she is unless you have the devil&#39;s own luck (which sometimes you do). The real key to Nightmist that I&#39;ve found is knowing which cards are discard fodder, since you&#39;re gonna do that a lot. And I think she has some of the best theming of all of them. I really do feel like I&#39;m a dabbler in the mystic arts that can often backfire on you but will damage your opponents much more and that are unpredictable.</p>",
